    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers are delighted to present 44 Johnsgate, Limerick. This 3 bed townhouse\r\nhas been recently renovated. Just 500m to O’Connell St., Johnsgate allows its new owner\r\nexperience the best of city living, while enjoying the comforts of parking and a large garden. \r\nThe property consists of a large living room come dining room, fully fitted kitchen with access\r\nto the rear driveway, The hallway provides understairs storage. \r\nThe first floor consists of the primary bedroom with a fully fitted ensuite, two further south\r\nfacing bedrooms and a fully fitted bathroom and hot-press."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway - 3.70m x 1.95m\r\nAccess to all parts of the home with under stairs storage.\r\nLiving Room - 4.20m x 3.66m\r\nCarpeted south facing with fireplace.\r\nDining Room - 3.34m x 2.71m\r\nCarpeted.\r\nKitchen - 3.34m x 2.90m\r\nFully fitted kitchen with access to rear.\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.81m x 3.26m\r\nDouble bedroom with ensuite, and fitted wardrobes\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.68m x 3.66m\r\nSouth facing with fitted wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.68m x 2.73m\r\nSouth facing.\r\nBathroom - 2.21m x 1.79m\r\nW.C., W.H.B., shower/bath unit."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
